            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The gold dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Flame**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, evocation, fire\n\nThe dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 40-foot cone that deals 15d6 fire damage (37 basic Reflex save).\n- **Weakening Gas**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, necromancy\n\nThe dragon breathes a blast of weakening gas. Each creature within a 40-foot cone must succeed at a 37 Fortitude save or become enfeebled 2 for 1 minute (or enfeebled 3 on a critical failure)."
            },
